WEBVTT

00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:15,350
My college has said that it doesn't matter what a cancer patient eats.

00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:20,940
How could they still be so ignorant?

00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:28,140
Um, yeah, I would agree that that is ignorance, and I don't mean that in a negative way,

00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:30,860
but it's just lack of knowledge.

00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:39,580
I don't understand how anybody, at this point in history, with the amount of knowledge that

00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:47,260
is available at your fingertips, that you can still think that your diet doesn't have anything

00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:49,580
to do with your health.

00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:54,900
Because certainly somebody with the more serious disease, their diet would have more

00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:00,500
to do with your health than somebody who is, let's say, feeling great, has no symptoms,

00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:06,140
doesn't have any weight issues, has no high blood pressure, has perfect blood work.

00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:11,500
But I guess I could understand a doctor saying, well, don't worry about what you eat

00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:13,860
because you're doing real well.

00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:20,620
But when someone has a health issue to say your diet doesn't do anything, beat anything,

00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:25,020
cause anything, I don't have an answer for this.

00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:28,860
I don't know how someone could be that foolish.

00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:39,100
I just don't know how you're maybe because you're so invested in a drug-based system that

00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:45,980
you can't divest yourself enough to have a rational thought.

00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:46,980
I don't know.

00:01:46,980 --> 00:02:07,260
You can tell to psychologist with that question, I guess.

